# API (NestJS)

- Modules live under `apps/api/src/modules/`. Reuse guards, org-scope utils, and existing DTO patterns.
- Enforce tenant isolation on every org-scoped controller/service.
- Prefer additive changes; keep webhook signature verification intact for payments/aggregators.
- Colocate tests as `*.test.ts` near critical utilities/modules.
- Super-admin auth is separate from org JWT—do not mix strategies.
